## withdraw
Withdraws a country from a treaty  
scope:treaty = {  
	withdraw = {  
		country = <country>	# must be valid and must be bound by the treaty  
		apply_break_penalties = yes/no	# optional, default no. If yes, break effects and on-actions apply when treaty is in binding time  
